---
source: lib/app/frontend/web/src/views.rs
expression: render_analytics_panels(&ctx).into_string()
---
<section class="grid gap-6 lg:grid-cols-2" id="analytics-overview"><div class="bg-white shadow-sm rounded-xl p-6 space-y-4"><div class="flex items-center justify-between"><h2 class="text-xl font-semibold">Analytics overview</h2><span class="text-sm text-slate-500">GET /analytics/ncit-summary</span></div><p class="text-xs text-slate-500">Mapping states mirror docs/system-design/ncit/behavior/sequence-servicerequest.md definitions so CLI/API screenshots remain accurate.</p><div class="space-y-3"><h3 class="text-sm font-semibold text-slate-800">Top NCIt concepts</h3><div class="grid gap-3 sm:grid-cols-2"><div class="rounded-lg border border-slate-200 p-3"><p class="text-sm font-semibold text-slate-800">FDG Uptake</p><p class="text-xs text-slate-500">C1234</p><p class="text-xs text-slate-500 mt-1">Count: 3</p></div></div></div><div class="space-y-2"><h3 class="text-sm font-semibold text-slate-800">Mapping states</h3><div class="flex items-center justify-between rounded-lg bg-slate-50 px-3 py-2 text-sm text-slate-700"><span>auto_mapped</span><span class="font-semibold">3</span></div><div class="flex items-center justify-between rounded-lg bg-slate-50 px-3 py-2 text-sm text-slate-700"><span>needs_review</span><span class="font-semibold">1</span></div></div><div class="space-y-2"><h3 class="text-sm font-semibold text-slate-800">Counts by time bucket</h3><p class="text-sm text-slate-500">No ordered_at timestamps available.</p></div></div><div class="bg-white shadow-sm rounded-xl p-6 space-y-4"><div class="flex items-center justify-between"><h2 class="text-xl font-semibold">Cohort exploration</h2><span class="text-sm text-slate-500">GET /analytics/cohort</span></div><form method="get" action="/analytics" class="grid gap-3 md:grid-cols-2 text-sm"><label class="flex flex-col gap-1" for="ncit_id"><span class="text-slate-700">NCIt ID</span><input type="text" id="ncit_id" name="ncit_id" value="" placeholder="CXXXX" class="rounded-lg border border-slate-300 px-3 py-2"></input></label><label class="flex flex-col gap-1" for="status"><span class="text-slate-700">Status</span><input type="text" id="status" name="status" value="" placeholder="active|completed" class="rounded-lg border border-slate-300 px-3 py-2"></input></label><label class="flex flex-col gap-1" for="date_from"><span class="text-slate-700">Date from (YYYY-MM-DD)</span><input type="text" id="date_from" name="date_from" value="" class="rounded-lg border border-slate-300 px-3 py-2"></input></label><label class="flex flex-col gap-1" for="date_to"><span class="text-slate-700">Date to (YYYY-MM-DD)</span><input type="text" id="date_to" name="date_to" value="" class="rounded-lg border border-slate-300 px-3 py-2"></input></label><button type="submit" class="inline-flex items-center justify-center rounded-lg bg-emerald-600 px-4 py-2 text-white font-medium hover:bg-emerald-700 md:col-span-2">Apply cohort filters</button></form><p class="text-sm text-slate-600">Matched 1 orders</p><div class="overflow-x-auto"><table class="min-w-full border border-slate-200 rounded-lg text-sm"><thead class="bg-slate-50"><tr><th class="px-3 py-2 text-left text-slate-600">SR ID</th><th class="px-3 py-2 text-left text-slate-600">Patient</th><th class="px-3 py-2 text-left text-slate-600">Encounter</th><th class="px-3 py-2 text-left text-slate-600">NCIt</th><th class="px-3 py-2 text-left text-slate-600">Status</th><th class="px-3 py-2 text-left text-slate-600">Intent</th><th class="px-3 py-2 text-left text-slate-600">Ordered at</th><th class="px-3 py-2 text-left text-slate-600">State</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr class="border-t border-slate-200"><td class="px-3 py-2 font-medium text-slate-800">SR-1</td><td class="px-3 py-2">P1</td><td class="px-3 py-2">E1</td><td class="px-3 py-2">C1234</td><td class="px-3 py-2">active</td><td class="px-3 py-2">order</td><td class="px-3 py-2">2024-05-01T12:00:00Z</td><td class="px-3 py-2">auto_mapped</td></tr></tbody></table></div></div></section>
